    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like all that work was for nothing. i spent years just waiting for the next crisis, the next hospital visit... and it still ended like this. i feel like i wasted my whole life for a result that didn't even happen. i'm just so empty. it's like there's nothing left for me here.",
